==== Status ====
   * most things work as expected by now
   * pinctrl details are missing for USB and AHCI power regulator control
   * kernel still lacks support for video (being worked on) and audio (snd-card-simple?)
   * rtl8192cu mac80211 driver AP/hostapd support seems to be broken (association fails) in compat-wireless 2014-11-04, fixes were merged upstream, OpenWrt backport at [[http://patchwork.ozlabs.org/patch/435596/]]
   * Please refer to [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.allwinner.sunxi#status|soc.allwinner.sunxi]] regarding the Allwinner A20 SOC.


