===== Hardware =====
==== Serial ====

You can use your usual serial levelshifter. Pinout is:

<code>
                           GND TX RX
             J12   o  o  o  o  o  o
{SD slot}          o  o  o  o
</code>

==== Switch configuration ====

<code>
 ------ ------ ------ ------   -----
| LAN1 | LAN2 | LAN3 | LAN4 | | WAN |
 ------ ------ ------ ------   -----
</code>

The port indexes in OpenWrt and in hardware (on the case) are mangled:
^ Port   ^ index in /etc/config/network   ^
| CPU    | 8                              |
| LAN1   | 2                              |
| LAN2   | 1                              |
| LAN3   | 0                              |
| LAN4   | 4                              |
| WAN    | 3                              |


